n’t assume additional fields are present.", "[GMAIL_FETCH_EMAILS] Cutoff operators are easy to invert (before vs after / older-than vs newer-than), risking unintended deletions.", "[GMAIL_BATCH_DELETE_MESSAGES] Returns acceptance-level success without per-message status; invalid/already-removed IDs may be silently skipped."], "reference_workbench_snippets": [{"description": "Paginate ids_only results safely and dedupe message IDs (handles messageId vs id and falsy nextPageToken).", "code": "```python
