    b=p.get('body') or {}
    if fn and fn!='unknown' and b.get('attachmentId'): out.append((fn,b['attachmentId']))
    walk(p.get('parts'),out)
found=[]
walk((message.get('payload') or {}).get('parts'),found)
```"}, {"description": "Paginate Gmail results until nextPageToken is missing/empty", "code": "```python
